	(text "LED supply: Q1 switches battery voltage onto LED_VDD when P1.00 (LED_EN) is high.\nR1/R2 keep it off during boot. ZMK: ext-power on P1.00 for the LEDs only;\nVCC (trackpad, header) stays on. Close JP1 to drive the LEDs from P0.06."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
