	(text "Trackpad: Azoteq TPS43 (IQS572), I2C at 1.65-3.6 V.\nJ2 is six bare pads for short wires to the module's own pads (no FPC, keeps it thin),\nin the module's order: SDA, SCL, 3V3, GND, RST, RDY (datasheet v1.06, figure 2.1)."
